# ROG Phone 5 (SM8350) build: Arch Linux packaging gnome-shell 1:50.5-1, but
# the source is GNOME Shell Mobile (World/MobileShell/gnome-shell-mobile,
# branch mobile-shell-devel-50, 50.3 based) with GNOME 50.5 merged in (0001,
# conflicts resolved, every 50.4/50.5 lock-screen fix checked: ../README.md),
# a stray conflict marker fixed (0002), two postmarketOS fixes (0003, 0004)
# and seven ROG5 patches (0005-0011: no lock-screen overlays, no notification
# actions/URLs/quick-settings list while locked, no PIN input while auth is
# blocked, panel stays dark after a non-user resume, idle blank locks again on
# GNOME 50, lock screen shown before blanking). Opt-in only; it replaces gnome-shell and needs
# mutter-mobile of the same version. Not in configs/rootfs/custom-packages.txt.

